        <p>
          <strong>Skippy</strong> - the person whose work pulled me back when I was ready to stop. Go find <em>Nuclear Tech: Integrated</em> and give it a look.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>bablodima228 (Dima)</strong> - the first real friend of this project. Found me on Twitch when there was nothing here, and has been there at every step since.
        </p>
      </div>

